# Vercel serves one file: the web app. Everything else in this repository is
# the desktop program, its tests, its data and the design canvas, none of
# which belongs on a public URL.
#
# Deployment is decided by "outputDirectory" in vercel.json, which is built
# from index.html alone. This list keeps the rest out of the build as well,
# so nothing can be served by accident.
*

!index.html
!vercel.json
